---
// Hero.astro - Clean Modern Light Design
---

<section class="relative pt-12 pb-16 lg:pt-20 lg:pb-24 overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-white via-slate-50/50 to-slate-50">
  <!-- Subtle Light Glow -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-hero-glow pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-8 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Copy & CTAs -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 text-center lg:text-left">
        
        <!-- Live status badge (Clean Light Pill) -->
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200/80 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800 shadow-sm">
          <span class="flex h-2.5 w-2.5 relative">
            <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-emerald-500 opacity-75"></span>
            <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2.5 w-2.5 bg-emerald-600"></span>
          </span>
          Vagas abertas para o Brasil · Pagamentos semanais via Pix
        </div>

        <!-- H1 Primary SEO Title -->
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-slate-900 leading-[1.12] tracking-tight">
          Treinar IA: <span class="text-emerald-600">ganhe em dólar</span> fazendo tarefas do dia a dia
        </h1>

        <!-- Subtitle -->
        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 font-normal leading-relaxed">
          Empresas globais de robótica pagam entre <strong class="text-slate-900 font-bold">$5 e $8 por hora</strong> para você gravar vídeos simples de rotina (cozinhar, arrumar e trabalhar) usando a câmera do seu celular. <span class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Sem precisar aparecer</span> e sem experiência prévia.
        </p>

        <!-- CTA Buttons -->
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4 pt-2">
          <a
            href="/plataformas"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center px-7 py-4 text-base font-bold rounded-xl text-white bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 transition-all duration-200 shadow-md shadow-emerald-600/20 hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5"
          >
            Ver plataformas que pagam
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 ml-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
            </svg>
          </a>

          <!-- PLACEHOLDER: Altere o link para o seu canal/grupo real -->
          <a
            href="https://t.me/PLACEHOLDER_CANAL_TELEGRAM"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center px-7 py-4 text-base font-bold rounded-xl text-slate-700 bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 transition-all border border-slate-300 shadow-sm hover:border-slate-400"
          >
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2 text-sky-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm4.64 6.8c-.15 1.58-.8 5.42-1.13 7.19-.14.75-.42 1-.68 1.03-.58.05-1.02-.38-1.58-.75-.88-.58-1.38-.94-2.23-1.5-.99-.65-.35-1.01.22-1.59.15-.15 2.71-2.48 2.76-2.69a.2.2 0 00-.05-.18c-.06-.05-.14-.03-.21-.02-.09.02-1.49.95-4.22 2.79-.4.27-.76.41-1.08.4-.36-.01-1.04-.2-1.55-.37-.63-.2-1.12-.31-1.08-.66.02-.18.27-.36.74-.55 2.92-1.27 4.86-2.11 5.83-2.52 2.77-1.17 3.35-1.37 3.73-1.38.08 0 .27.02.39.12.1.08.13.19.14.27-.01.06.01.24 0 .38z"/>
            </svg>
            Entrar na comunidade
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Trust bullet tags with clean light styling -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-5 pt-3 text-sm text-slate-700 font-medium">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            Não precisa mostrar o rosto
          </span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            Saques semanais em Pix
          </span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            100% gratuito para começar
          </span>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Social Proof / Payment Proof Mockup -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative flex justify-center">
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-md">
          
          <!-- Clean Card Container -->
          <div class="relative rounded-2xl p-2 bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xl">
            <!-- PLACEHOLDER: Imagem com print real de comprovante Pix -->
            <img
              src="/images/social-proof-pix.svg"
              alt="Comprovante de pagamento Pix recebido de plataforma de treinamento de IA"
              class="w-full h-auto rounded-xl object-contain"
              width="540"
              height="380"
              loading="eager"
            />
            <div class="p-2 text-center">
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">
                ★ Comprovante verificado de membro brasileiro recebendo em Pix semanalmente.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
